      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Random steering policy distributes traffic across all 3 origins  • Health checks on /health endpoint (60s interval)  • No public IPs - all traffic via Cloudflare Tunnels\n• TTL=1s for frequent origin switching on page refresh  • Check regions: WEU, ENAM, SEAS  • Each origin runs identical Swiss Insurance website",
